		c	Example:\n <pre>\n     {@code\n    DebugSpecialElement graphs = DebugRegistryUtils.registerSpecialElement(new ResourceLocation("btw:graphs"));\n    graphs.addEntry(((mc, isExtendedDebug) ->{\n \t\t\tScaledResolution scaledresolution = new ScaledResolution(mc.gameSettings, mc.displayWidth, mc.displayHeight);\n \t\t\tint width = scaledresolution.getScaledWidth();\n\n \t\t\tdrawMetricsData(mc, mc.getFpsMetricsData(), 0, 0, width / 2, (byte) 1);\n \t\t }\n \t\t ));\n     }\n </pre>\n The code inside {@code .addEntry((mc, isExtendedDebug) -> {});} will run when all special elements are drawn on the debug screen. <br>\n In this case, it will draw the fps graph when the special element: {@code graphs}'s entries are drawn.
